{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28042","headline":"送黄晔明府岳州湘阴赴任 · 厉玄","name":"送黄晔明府岳州湘阴赴任","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"恩沾谴雪几人同，归宰湘阴六月中。\n商岭马嘶残暑雨，席帆高挂早秋风。\n贡名频向书闱失，飞檄曾传朔漠空。\n西省尚嗟君宦远，水鸡啼处莫听鸿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"厉玄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28042.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28042","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}